## Statement of changes

Moe contributors changed imported source and documentation while consolidating
repositories, replacing product identifiers and paths, reconciling duplicated
implementations, changing build systems, and integrating the resulting
packages. Historical files explicitly retained as evidence may remain
unchanged. Git history and PARITY.md identify the frozen comparison revisions.

